  "refutation_reason": "The counterexample fails to refute the assertion because it incorrectly attributes the solution of narrow-domain tasks to 'broad general knowledge' when the task constraints and input distribution may be sufficient for the model to operate without invoking that broader knowledge. The assertion claims the system does not utilize broad knowledge given narrow inputs; if the narrow context is self-sufficient, the counterexample's claim of utilization is false under those specific conditions.",
  "refutes_exact_assertion": false
}
